  "description": "SGuard is a lightweight guard library for .NET that offers boolean checks (Is.*) and throwing guards (ThrowIf.*), a unified SGuardCallback/GuardOutcome model, and exceptions that name the failing argument via CallerArgumentExpression. A passing guard doesn't allocate, and selectors are compiled once and cached. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
